This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its two subjects are scripts/readset-stage1-run.sh and scripts/readset-stage1-verdict.sh, which
live in the repo-root scripts/ and are not in install.sh's copy loop (that loop ships
core/scripts/ only). They measure the sandbox read-set tracer's completeness on this
repository's own heaviest fixtures and record the runs in this repository's git common dir; a
consumer tree has neither script and no stage-1 ledger. On a consumer this fixture would resolve
no subject and could only refuse with FIXTURE BROKEN.
